  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"1077\">\n<p data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"964\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"962\">Normal (&lt;30 U/mL):</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1077\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1004\">\n<p data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1004\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Usually within reference limits.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1077\">\n<p data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1077\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Not diagnostic alone; correlate with clinical and imaging findings.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1235\">\n<p data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1118\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1116\">Mildly Elevated (30&ndash;100 U/mL):</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1235\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1204\">\n<p data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1204\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">May be seen in benign conditions (liver disease, ovarian cysts, inflammation).</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1235\">\n<p data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1235\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Serial monitoring needed.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1454\">\n<p data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1281\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1279\">Significantly Elevated (&gt;100 U/mL):</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1454\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1370\">\n<p data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1370\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Suggestive of active or metastatic breast carcinoma (if consistent with history).</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1454\">\n<p data-start=\"1376\" data-end=\"1454\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Used for <strong data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1433\">treatment response and recurrence monitoring</strong> &ndash; not for screening.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
